<title>Lesson Activities </title>
<para>Here are the instructional activities for the lesson: </para>
<list>
  <item>4.5.1: Finding Solutions of Equations </item>
  <item>4.5.2: Using the Vertical Line Test
    <list>
      <item>4.5.2: Self Check </item>
      <item>4.5.2: Additional Resources</item>
    </list>
  </item>
  <item>4.5.3: Comparing Functions
    <list>
      <item>4.5.3: Self Check </item>
      <item>4.5.3: Additional Resources</item>
    </list>
  </item>
  <item>4.5.4: Using Function Notation and Graphing Technology
    <list>
      <item>4.5.4: Self Check </item>
      <item>4.5.4: Additional Resources</item>
    </list>
  </item>
  <item>4.5.5: Using Graphical and Algebraic Approaches for Finding Unknowns of Linear Functions</item>
</list>
<para>Students will also complete a series of problems in the 4.5.6: Practice.</para>
<title>Required Materials </title>
<para>Graphing technology </para>
<title>Required Preparation </title>
<para>For the extension activity Function Notation and Graphing Technology, acquire devices that can run Desmos (recommended) or other graphing technology. It is ideal if each student has their own device. </para>
<title>Lesson Vocabulary </title>
<para>During this lesson, it is important to:</para>
<list>
  <item>Familiarize students with the vocabulary words they will see throughout the lesson. Encourage students to look for these words and notice their use and meanings. </item>
  <item>Encourage students to use key vocabulary words in “math talk” and their written and oral explanations.</item>
  <item>Utilize a word wall. Sample cards are located here: <link url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/8ed3aa68763498713b44d3c2e537ffe61b4755f0">Mathematics Vocabulary Word Wall Cards</link></item>
</list>
<para>Vocabulary words that are emphasized in this lesson include:</para>

